# ---------------------------------------------------------------- data
# data/raw/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The assignment requires that
# data/raw/ contains exactly what the API returned, so all 49 responses
# are committed (about 22 MB).
#
# data/processed/ is DERIVED. Two files are kept because they let anyone
# re-run the analysis and the model without an API key:
#     daily_panel.csv     the joined daily panel
#     model_table.csv     the modelling table with features and targets
# The rest are large intermediates that `python run_all.py` rebuilds.
data/processed/openmeteo_air_hourly.csv
data/processed/openmeteo_weather_hourly.csv
data/processed/openmeteo_forecast_hourly.csv
data/processed/firms_hotspots.csv
